    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structcub_1_1DeviceMerge" kindref="compound">DeviceMerge</ref> provides device-wide, parallel operations for merging two sorted sequences of values (called keys) or key-value pairs in device-accessible memory. The sorting order is determined by a comparison functor (default: less-than), which has to establish a <ulink url="https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/concepts/strict_weak_order">strict weak ordering</ulink>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
